  "title": "Guns&Fun",
  "description": "Military Themed Modpack - Real World Gun, Vehicles, Body Armor, Aircraft, Fighting!",
  "body": "![Guns And Fun](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8856fea84a22af89b931de9c5b159b911de4de57.webp)\n\n**<center> Military Themed Modpack - Gun, Vehicles, Body Armor, Aircraft, Fighting! </center>**\n\n<table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>       \n        <td width=\"30%\">\n            <h2> 💥 Quality Guns</h2>\n            <p> 100+ High Detail firearms -> M4A1, Glock, Aug, AK47, Rocket Launcher and more... </p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"70%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9104d1a3e5fe8016af1f516a33293de59750cdb9.webp\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n\n<table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>              \n  <td width=\"70%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/PG49Mdfs/images/550ef83f2ec5af996e979787789547d76e266261.webp\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"30%\">\n            <h2> 🚓 Vehicles </h2>\n            <p>15+ Powerful vehicles \n- military aircraft \n- armored tanks, \n- Fast boats.\n- 5+ Powerful Turrets </p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>                     \n        <td width=\"30%\">\n            <h2> ✈️ Aircraft </h2>\n            <p>15+ Powerful vehicles \n- military aircraft \n- armored tanks, \n- Fast boats.\n- 5+ Powerful Turrets </p>\n        </td>\n  <td width=\"70%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/PG49Mdfs/images/980cffd454b9dc9e20bef99e3da92af80aaf7984.webp\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>       \n        <td width=\"70%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/PG49Mdfs/images/de681fa2246abd1598b0edbe4ffb5250feff1c7a.webp\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"30%\">\n            <h2> 🪖 Realistic Gear</h2>\n            <p> 10+ realistic military themed armor sets, Real life weapons. Crowbars, Machette, katanas, Cammo </p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>       \n        <td width=\"30%\">\n            <h2> ☠️ Fight</h2>\n            <p> Over 300 monster were added. FIGHT, SURVIVE, CONQUER. some of them are every dangerous </p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"70%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/edec9db1d52a13cb1974f3fc129b8933edd5bcb2.webp\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>              \n        <td width=\"65%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b6d7dccd0de67ea440b2dc54c77b424c5fa48597.webp\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"35%\">\n            <h2> 🗺️ Explore Structures</h2>\n            <p> Hundreds of new structures for you to explore, Get better loot and fight monsters</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Can my PC handle this modpack?\nYes! We crafted this modpack to be light weight and optimized. To get even more performance you can try these things: \n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Tips To Get Better Performance</summary>\n\n- Disable Shaders: Options -> Video Settings -> Oculus -> Shaders: Disabled\n- Disable Minimap: Mods -> Xaeros's Minimap -> Config -> Minimap: Off\n- Lower Render Distance: Options -> Video settings -> Render distance\n- Lower Simulation Distance: Options -> Video settings -> Simulation distance\n- Allocate More Ram We recommend 4-6gb\n- Update All your drivers\n\n</details>\n\n#\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/uSzRGWqgn3\">\n<img alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/gunsfun/gallery\">\n<img alt=\"modrinth-gallery\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/modrinth-gallery_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://affiliate.godlike.host/jessdX\">\n  \n<img alt=\"modrinth-gallery\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6898eaf4bfc6061c0d4d041e47e137154ecaca83.png\">\n\n</a>\n \n# \n\n### 👀 Play with friends\nWant to run a flawless modded server? Check out Godlike Host! Setting up a server through them is the absolute best way to support us right now.\n\nDon't just take our word for it—read the community reviews here: [Best Minecraft Server Hosting.](https://www.reddit.com/r/MinecraftServer/comments/1i1zl4s/best_minecraft_server_hosting/)\n\n👉 Click the image below or use this link: [Godlike Host](https://affiliate.godlike.host/jessdX) to get 50% off your first month!\n\n\n<a href=\"https://affiliate.godlike.host/jessdX\">\n <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fdf622a963af2acff021f32b7653c5a4dc7ca570.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting Link\"> \n</a>",
